105:         // needed even the configured network buffers per channel is 0 and this behavior is for
106:         // performance. If it's not guaranteed that each subpartition can get at least one buffer,
107:         // more partial buffers with little data will be outputted to network/disk and recycled to
108:         // be used by other subpartitions which can not get a buffer for data caching.
