124:      * Base paths for ForSt remote directory, as configured. Null if not yet set, in which case the
125:      * configuration values will be used. The configuration will fallback to local directory by
126:      * default. TODO: fallback to checkpoint directory if not configured.
127:      */
128:     @Nullable private Path remoteForStDirectory;
129: 
130:     /**
131:      * Base paths for ForSt directory, as configured. Null if not yet set, in which case the
132:      * configuration values will be used. The configuration defaults to the TaskManager's temp
133:      * directories.
134:      */
135:     @Nullable private File[] localForStDirectories;
136: 
137:     /** The configurable options. */
138:     @Nullable private ReadableConfig configurableOptions;
139: 
140:     /** The options factory to create the ForSt options in the cluster. */
141:     @Nullable private ForStOptionsFactory forStOptionsFactory;
142: 
143:     /** The configuration for memory settings (pool sizes, etc.). */
144:     private final ForStMemoryConfiguration memoryConfiguration;
145: 
146:     /** The default ForSt property-based metrics options. */
147:     private final ForStNativeMetricOptions nativeMetricOptions;
148: 
149:     // -- runtime values, set on TaskManager when initializing / using the backend
150: 
