643:     /**
644:      * Shuts down the mini cluster, failing all currently executing jobs. The mini cluster can be
645:      * started again by calling the {@link #start()} method again.
646:      *
647:      * <p>This method shuts down all started services and components, even if an exception occurs in
648:      * the process of shutting down some component.
649:      *
650:      * @return Future which is completed once the MiniCluster has been completely shut down
651:      */
652:     @Override
653:     public CompletableFuture<Void> closeAsync() {
654:         return closeInternal(true);
655:     }
