72:     /**
73:      * Invokable that produces records and allows slowdown via {@link #IS_SLOW_EVERY_NUM_RECORDS}
74:      * and {@link #IS_SLOW_SENDER_CONFIG_KEY} and creates records of different data sizes via {@link
75:      * #DATA_VOLUME_GB_CONFIG_KEY}.
76:      *
77:      * <p>NOTE: needs to be <tt>public</tt> so that a task can be run with this!
