960:      *
961:      * <pre>
962:      *  	source -|-> middle -|-> sink
963:      * </pre>
964:      *
965:      * <p>Parallelism of source and middle is 5.
966:      *
967:      * <p>Edge (source --> middle) is BLOCKING and POINTWISE. Edge (middle --> sink) is BLOCKING and
968:      * ALL_TO_ALL.
969:      *
970:      * <p>Source has an operator coordinator.
